            "review_text": "David B\nToronto, Canada519 contributions\n0\nTake a break here\nOct 2019\nTravelling on my own, enjoyed BBQ ribs here with Tiger beer. Maybe not quite as good as Texas, but darn delicious considering where we are. Many western foods on an English menu and the staff spoke a tiny bit of English too, it helped. Friendly service and helped me get a cab after dinner to my hotel.\n\nNOTE - I think the location listed in Trip Advisor is about 1km away from actual, and Restaurant name is Ong Tay Quan (NOT Quan Ong Tay)\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 9, 2019",
